little reminder: it’s okay to do nothing to your ~aging~ face…and it’s also okay to do whatever you want 📣❕

i’m going to be honest. the past two years i’ve definitely noticed my skin changing - the texture is different, lines that weren’t there before. some days I love it, some days I’m adjusting and practicing neutrality. 

right now, i’m trying to love my face as it evolves instead of rushing to fix it. i’m not against doing something in the future, and truly believe everyone should feel empowered to make whatever choices feel RIGHT.

